IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pea-licensing`

-- Public Entertainments Act 1958, ss 4, 28, 32 and First Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_pea.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

